    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Fix CVE-2026-73088 (boo#1275410): the embedded browserslist 4.28.2 flagged by the security scanner lives solely in WebKit/Tools/WebKitBot/package-lock.json inside the WebKit source archive - Apple's CI bot tooling, never read by a JSCOnly build, never compiled or shipped, and upstream bun main still pins the same vulnerable revision, so a version bump would not help. Pruned Tools/WebKitBot from the archive and extended the bun_webkit generator prune list; repacked archive verified to contain zero browserslist references, full local aarch64 build green including %check smoke tests.</comment>
